msgid "Multi-WAN (swanix)"
msgstr "多线路 (swanix)"

msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概览"

msgid "Lines"
msgstr "线路"

msgid "Policies"
msgstr "策略"

msgid "Health checks"
msgstr "健康检测"

msgid "IPv6"
msgstr "IPv6"

msgid "Proxy"
msgstr "代理"

msgid "System / Diagnostics"
msgstr "系统 / 诊断"

msgid "Multi-WAN overview"
msgstr "多线路概览"

msgid "New-connection share"
msgstr "新连接分配比例"

msgid "\"New-connection share\" is how many new connections the scheduler hands to a line. It is not a bandwidth share: one connection always stays on one line."
msgstr "“新连接分配比例”是调度器分给某条线路的新连接数量占比，不是带宽占比：单个连接始终只走一条线路。"

msgid "Down / Up now"
msgstr "当前下行 / 上行"

msgid "Capacity"
msgstr "配置容量"

msgid "Probe RTT (base)"
msgstr "探测 RTT（基线）"

msgid "Probe failure rate"
msgstr "探测失败率"

msgid "Reason"
msgstr "原因"

msgid "Recent state changes"
msgstr "最近状态变化"

msgid "Confirm"
msgstr "确认"

msgid "Roll back now"
msgstr "立即回滚"

msgid "Confirm the new multi-WAN setup"
msgstr "确认新的多线路配置"

msgid "Switched to swanix. Confirm within the time limit or the previous setup is restored automatically."
msgstr "已切换到 swanix。请在时限内确认，否则将自动恢复原有配置。"

msgid "healthy"
msgstr "正常"

msgid "degraded"
msgstr "质量下降"

msgid "recovering"
msgstr "恢复中"

msgid "down"
msgstr "中断"

msgid "unknown"
msgstr "未知"

msgid "Close connections on a failed line"
msgstr "线路故障时关闭其上的连接"

msgid "When a line goes down, close the proxy connections that were dialled through it, so long-lived sessions (mux, HTTP/2, QUIC) reconnect over a healthy line at once instead of waiting for their own timeouts."
msgstr "线路故障时关闭经由该线路建立的代理连接，使长连接（多路复用、HTTP/2、QUIC）立即通过健康线路重连，而不是等待各自超时。"

msgid "Transparent takeover"
msgstr "透明接管"

msgid "With \"TUN\" the tun inbound in proxy.json (auto_route, without auto_redirect) takes the LAN traffic; swanix checks its rule priorities, routing table and marks against its own, and outbounds with wan_policy pick the line per connection."
msgstr "选择“TUN”时，由 proxy.json 中的 tun 入站（auto_route，不开 auto_redirect）接管 LAN 流量；swanix 会核对其规则优先级、路由表与 mark 不与自身冲突，设置了 wan_policy 的出站按连接选择线路。"

msgid "Off"
msgstr "关闭"

msgid "Saturation threshold (%)"
msgstr "满载阈值（%）"

msgid "Optional. When a line carries this share of its configured bandwidth and another member is below it, new connections go to the unsaturated lines; the line takes new connections again once it is 10 points below. 0 or empty: off."
msgstr "可选。线路流量达到其配置带宽的该比例、且策略中还有未达阈值的线路时，新连接改走未满载的线路；回落到阈值以下 10 个百分点后恢复分配。0 或留空表示关闭。"

msgid "per source + destination address"
msgstr "按源地址 + 目的地址"
